  {
    "content_key": "text_cbf63b1da86a434cdc81dd0f__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "I dream of giving more people the experience of “awe” — that feeling when you forget yourself and sense that you are part of something greater. That you belong. That you are present, both within yourself and in your surroundings.\n\nIn that moment, you are also free from your head and your thoughts. There is presence, calm, and perhaps even a small shift within.",
    "headline": "team.Silje Hoegmark.description",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "أحلم بأن أمنح مزيداً من الناس تجربة «الدهشة»؛ ذلك الشعور حين تنسى نفسك وتدرك أنك جزء من شيء أكبر. أنك تنتمي. وأنك حاضر، في داخلك وفيما يحيط بك.\n\nفي تلك اللحظة، تتحرر أيضاً من ضجيج ذهنك وأفكارك. تحضر السكينة والوعي، وربما يحدث في داخلك تحول صغير.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1002,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_9637f6b780262e0fe5d1e7b8__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
