  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_b980147ed6edc22169365f95__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Hoi!",
    "headline": "chapters.Amsterdam.headline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "مرحباً!",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1070,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_e595f45dc6c9e7665d108e8e__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Europe",
    "headline": "chapters.Amsterdam.continent",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "أوروبا",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1071,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_f254841a67846cd1b8e821e0__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "For centuries, Amsterdam has been a city of merchants, pioneers and unconventional thinkers. A place that built its prosperity by challenging the familiar. Today, Amsterdam is asking a different question: What if success is not simply about having more, but about creating more value for everyone? From pioneering Doughnut Economics to experimenting with circular business models, the city is exploring a new understanding of prosperity, where economic ambition, human wellbeing and planetary responsibility go hand in hand. The IOBS Amsterdam Chapter brings together people who believe that success deserves a new definition.",
    "headline": "chapters.Amsterdam.description",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "منذ قرون، كانت أمستردام مدينة التجار والروّاد وأصحاب الفكر غير التقليدي؛ مكاناً بنى ازدهاره بتحدّي المألوف. واليوم تطرح أمستردام سؤالاً مختلفاً: ماذا لو لم يكن النجاح مجرد امتلاك المزيد، بل خلق قيمة أكبر للجميع؟ من ريادة اقتصاد الدونات إلى تجربة نماذج الأعمال الدائرية، تستكشف المدينة فهماً جديداً للازدهار، يسير فيه الطموح الاقتصادي ورفاه الإنسان والمسؤولية تجاه الكوكب جنباً إلى جنب. يجمع فرع IOBS في أمستردام أشخاصاً يؤمنون بأن النجاح يستحق تعريفاً جديداً.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1072,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_6c425048aa7badd9d84615bd__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Dubai",
    "headline": "chapters.Dubai.city",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "دبي",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1073,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_dd64913c8b91d76ca27b371f__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "United Arab Emirates",
    "headline": "chapters.Dubai.country",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "الإمارات العربية المتحدة",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1074,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_0a5150029cc729e2419c41de__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "As-salamu alaykum",
    "headline": "chapters.Dubai.headline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "السلام عليكم",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1075,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_7ac02ec1c874b1daffd3a062__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Asia",
    "headline": "chapters.Dubai.continent",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "آسيا",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1076,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_f06f1dbc40c30208951e3b50__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Dubai has a remarkable history of turning audacious ambitions into reality. A city that has repeatedly challenged what others considered possible, proving that the future is not something we simply wait for, but something we create. It was here, inspired by this spirit of possibility, that the idea for the Institute of Beautiful Success was born. Our ambition is no less audacious: to establish a new global standard for success, one that celebrates not only what we achieve, but also the value we create for others and the world around us. The IOBS Dubai Chapter brings together people who believe that even the boldest visions can become reality.",
    "headline": "chapters.Dubai.description",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "لدبي تاريخ لافت في تحويل الطموحات الجريئة إلى واقع. مدينة تحدّت مراراً ما اعتبره الآخرون ممكناً، وأثبتت أن المستقبل ليس شيئاً ننتظره فحسب، بل شيئاً نصنعه. هنا، وبإلهام من روح الإمكانات هذه، وُلدت فكرة معهد النجاح الجميل. وطموحنا لا يقل جرأة: إرساء معيار عالمي جديد للنجاح، يحتفي بما نحققه وبالقيمة التي نخلقها للآخرين وللعالم من حولنا. يجمع فرع IOBS في دبي أشخاصاً يؤمنون بأن أكثر الرؤى جرأة يمكن أن تصبح حقيقة.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1077,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_5aa34886f7f3741de8460690__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "San Francisco",
    "headline": "chapters.San Francisco.city",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "سان فرانسيسكو",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1078,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_49dca65f362fee401292ed7a__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "United States",
    "headline": "chapters.San Francisco.country",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "الولايات المتحدة",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1079,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_e51d9f1682167b08faef2bfc__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Welcome to the City of Awe",
    "headline": "chapters.San Francisco.headline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "أهلاً بكم في مدينة الدهشة",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1080,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_64be0885bc3f641cdfb1322e__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "North America",
    "headline": "chapters.San Francisco.continent",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "أمريكا الشمالية",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1081,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_91bcd83b0d84d4824b38eeb9__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "For decades, San Francisco has been a place where unconventional ideas challenge the status quo and reshape the world. But changing the world requires more than bold ideas. It requires the courage to question what we believe we know. Born in the Bay Area, the Global Footprint Network demonstrates how data can challenge comfortable assumptions and reveal the true cost of our progress. Its work reminds us that what we measure shapes what we value, and ultimately what we celebrate. The IOBS San Francisco Chapter brings together people who believe that meaningful progress begins when curiosity, evidence and ambition meet.",
    "headline": "chapters.San Francisco.description",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "منذ عقود، كانت سان فرانسيسكو مكاناً تتحدّى فيه الأفكار غير التقليدية الواقع القائم وتعيد تشكيل العالم. لكن تغيير العالم يتطلب أكثر من أفكار جريئة؛ يتطلب الشجاعة للتشكيك فيما نظن أننا نعرفه. تُظهر Global Footprint Network، التي وُلدت في منطقة الخليج، كيف تستطيع البيانات تحدّي الافتراضات المريحة وكشف التكلفة الحقيقية لتقدمنا. ويذكّرنا عملها بأن ما نقيسه يشكّل ما نقدّره، وما نحتفي به في النهاية. يجمع فرع IOBS في سان فرانسيسكو أشخاصاً يؤمنون بأن التقدم الهادف يبدأ حين يلتقي الفضول بالدليل والطموح.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1082,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_db7ee413d60408e5d9107eb1__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Vienna",
    "headline": "chapters.Vienna.city",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "فيينا",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1083,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_c9cab0238debc6e55498e2c0__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Austria",
    "headline": "chapters.Vienna.country",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "النمسا",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1084,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_828422a318ab6118e5b65ca2__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Servus in Wien",
    "headline": "chapters.Vienna.headline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "مرحباً بكم في فيينا",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1085,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_4a219da734ea817f90e2015b__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "For centuries, Vienna has been a city where art, science and intellectual curiosity have shaped the way we understand the world. Today, consistently ranked among the world’s most liveable cities, Vienna offers another perspective on success: prosperity is not only about what we achieve, but about the quality of life we create. From its rich cultural heritage to its commitment to affordable housing, public spaces and social wellbeing, Vienna demonstrates how collective choices can turn economic strength into everyday value for people. The IOBS Vienna Chapter brings together people who believe that Beautiful Success should not only be measured in achievements, but experienced in the way we live.",
    "headline": "chapters.Vienna.description",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "منذ قرون، كانت فيينا مدينة يشكّل فيها الفن والعلم والفضول الفكري فهمنا للعالم. واليوم، وهي تحتل باستمرار مكانة بين أفضل مدن العالم للعيش، تقدم رؤية أخرى للنجاح: الازدهار يتعلق بما نحققه وبجودة الحياة التي نصنعها. من تراثها الثقافي الغني إلى التزامها بالسكن الميسور والمساحات العامة والرفاه الاجتماعي، تُظهر فيينا كيف تستطيع الخيارات الجماعية تحويل القوة الاقتصادية إلى قيمة يومية للناس. يجمع فرع IOBS في فيينا أشخاصاً يؤمنون بأن النجاح الجميل يُقاس بالإنجازات ويُعاش أيضاً في تفاصيل حياتنا.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1086,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_76f17ca4b396027714fb8836__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "The Beautiful Success Awards recognize achievements that make the world better through their success.",
    "headline": "site_copy.hero_me.body",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "تكرّم جوائز النجاح الجميل الإنجازات التي تجعل العالم أفضل من خلال نجاحها.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1087,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_80dd9677d8dced67a593ed8c__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Celebrating a better world, one Beautiful Success at a time.",
    "headline": "site_copy.site_claim.headline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "نحتفي بعالم أفضل، نجاحاً جميلاً تلو الآخر.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1088,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_9c202247f6a5e25c7eb97aa4__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Not every success deserves to be celebrated. We recognize achievements whose positive value compounds as they grow.",
    "headline": "site_copy.principle.body",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "ليس كل نجاح جديراً بالاحتفاء. نكرّم الإنجازات التي تتضاعف قيمتها الإيجابية كلما نمت.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1089,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_e172d8ad9153f9de1bd24ad0__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "The Beautiful Success Principle",
    "headline": "site_copy.principle.label",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "مبدأ النجاح الجميل",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1090,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_4004c3b5c31585a3ab90a42f__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "The more successful it becomes, the better the world becomes.",
    "headline": "site_copy.principle.headline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "كلما ازداد نجاحه، أصبح العالم أفضل.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1091,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_c10bf4a53fd5c303668fc7ee__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "A new social contract, measured",
    "headline": "site_copy.judging_intro.label",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "عقد اجتماعي جديد، قابل للقياس",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1092,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_bd93dac55957bd8b0c70f799__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Recognition begins where ordinary success metrics end.",
    "headline": "site_copy.judging_intro.headline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "يبدأ التقدير حيث تنتهي مقاييس النجاح المعتادة.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1093,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_22466b5a68ad045ff73e3f9c__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Recognition",
    "headline": "site_copy.recognition_intro.label",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "التقدير",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1094,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_2a7cec963a45f20754200a2c__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Scarce by design.",
    "headline": "site_copy.recognition_intro.headline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "نادر عن قصد.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1095,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_1bd5a279abdda2b9d1ac2f4f__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Founding voices from business, culture, science and public life will help define what humanity should celebrate as success.",
    "headline": "site_copy.voices_intro.body",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "ستساعد أصوات مؤسِّسة من الأعمال والثقافة والعلم والحياة العامة في تحديد ما ينبغي للبشرية أن تحتفي به بوصفه نجاحاً.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1096,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_0ee4a3cca7419dddb3b4eaca__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "The Beautiful Success Question",
    "headline": "site_copy.voices_intro.label",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "سؤال النجاح الجميل",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1097,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_7b60ba7630a8c4eff5cccf35__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "What does beautiful success mean to you?",
    "headline": "site_copy.voices_intro.headline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "ماذا يعني لك النجاح الجميل؟",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1098,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_bb876c1b860919940314b29e__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "The Founding Edition",
    "headline": "site_copy.founding_edition.label",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "الدورة التأسيسية",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1099,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_3b3a9ff6b2cc6679cc9b94fe__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "One global search. Seven scales. One Grand Prix.",
    "headline": "site_copy.founding_edition.headline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "بحث عالمي واحد. سبعة نطاقات. جائزة كبرى واحدة.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1100,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_23137895eb42db52fe881f40__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Dubai · Shenzhen · Hong Kong · Vienna · London · San Francisco · Lithuania",
    "headline": "site_copy.founding_edition.subheadline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "دبي · شنتشن · هونغ كونغ · فيينا · لندن · سان فرانسيسكو · ليتوانيا",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1101,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_428ab219711d35bd1031e455__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Grateful for our Beautiful Partners",
    "headline": "site_copy.partners_intro.headline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "ممتنون لشركائنا الرائعين",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1102,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_f834c648cafb867f236d1ea7__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Discover the Institute",
    "headline": "site_copy.v3_hero.body",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "اكتشف المعهد",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1103,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_8c50bc072a034480f3361bd8__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Beautiful Success",
    "headline": "site_copy.v3_hero.headline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "النجاح الجميل",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1104,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_297b143f503b651434709cc2__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Success is not the problem.\nOur definition of it is.",
    "headline": "site_copy.v3_hero.subheadline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "النجاح ليس المشكلة.\nتعريفنا له هو المشكلة.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1105,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_bb914bb17558d8bc78211f8a__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "For humans. For non-humans. For society. For the planet. For what comes after us.",
    "headline": "site_copy.v3_principle.body",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "للبشر. ولغير البشر. وللمجتمع. وللكوكب. ولمن يأتي بعدنا.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1106,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_38fe7a8ee82ed2e071859b88__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "02 — The Principle",
    "headline": "site_copy.v3_principle.label",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "02 — المبدأ",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1107,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_51c3af57abc6cafd7ce426f9__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "The five principles that define Beautiful Success",
    "headline": "site_copy.v3_principles_intro.headline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "المبادئ الخمسة التي تحدّد النجاح الجميل",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1108,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_3f977efa1bdf9fa10216e0a4__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "What's in it for me is a fundamental basic need of every human. But it is also a finite desire. There is only so much you can ask for. But what can be created if you focus on what you can offer, is unlimited.",
    "headline": "site_copy.v3_principle_philanthropy.body",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "السؤال عمّا سأجنيه حاجة أساسية لدى كل إنسان. لكنه أيضاً رغبة محدودة؛ فثمة حدّ لما يمكنك طلبه. أما ما يمكن خلقه حين تركّز على ما تستطيع تقديمه، فلا حدود له.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1109,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_838e8f39909ad5a2b29b6d79__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "PHILANTROPY",
    "headline": "site_copy.v3_principle_philanthropy.label",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "العطاء",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1110,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_ac26eabf4b4f1dc365cfa98b__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "What can I offer",
    "headline": "site_copy.v3_principle_philanthropy.headline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "ماذا أستطيع أن أقدّم؟",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1111,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_c404d06b7dfbddad86f756d1__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Give > Take",
    "headline": "site_copy.v3_principle_philanthropy.subheadline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "العطاء > الأخذ",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1112,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_8e574c3df111546e4e130ddb__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Protecting drains a lot of energy and ressources. What would be possible if we could direct the same resources into creation of something that does not need protection?",
    "headline": "site_copy.v3_principle_new_focus.body",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "تستنزف الحماية كثيراً من الطاقة والموارد. ما الذي قد يصبح ممكناً لو وجّهنا الموارد نفسها إلى خلق شيء لا يحتاج إلى حماية؟",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1113,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_e3c944e4e0c563a3e71ec060__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "New Focus",
    "headline": "site_copy.v3_principle_new_focus.label",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "تركيز جديد",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1114,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_e04915780ecc54d7175a4626__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "What can I create?",
    "headline": "site_copy.v3_principle_new_focus.headline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "ماذا أستطيع أن أخلق؟",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1115,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_6578ff4e4e8dd69e3caba71b__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "What if there is nothing to protect.",
    "headline": "site_copy.v3_principle_new_focus.subheadline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "ماذا لو لم يكن هناك ما يحتاج إلى حماية؟",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1116,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_b9140f8775841194708e35bc__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "You are who you surround yourself with. The average of your inner circle of 5 makes your personality. But what is the echo you create in your circle? What do people think differently after interacting with you?",
    "headline": "site_copy.v3_principle_echo.body",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "أنت تتأثر بمن تحيط نفسك بهم. فمتوسط صفات أقرب خمسة أشخاص إليك يسهم في تشكيل شخصيتك. لكن ما الصدى الذي تتركه في دائرتك؟ ما الذي يفكّر فيه الناس بصورة مختلفة بعد تفاعلهم معك؟",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1117,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_8335e4c92c40556ab31f1bc5__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Echo",
    "headline": "site_copy.v3_principle_echo.label",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "الصدى",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1118,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_e38b43b6956cd71ef5d691d0__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Whose choices do I influence?",
    "headline": "site_copy.v3_principle_echo.headline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "في خيارات مَن أؤثّر؟",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1119,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_f8fecb819effb55df77ed745__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "All the people you know.",
    "headline": "site_copy.v3_principle_echo.subheadline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "كل الأشخاص الذين تعرفهم.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1120,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_86a4d513da1e9c75bde1ee9c__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Every asset you have is energy. Most of most peoples assets are passive energy. What if this energy can be turned into momentum - and everything you own creates something new...",
    "headline": "site_copy.v3_principle_momentum.body",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "كل أصل تملكه هو طاقة. ومعظم أصول معظم الناس طاقة ساكنة. ماذا لو تحولت هذه الطاقة إلى زخم، وأصبح كل ما تملكه يخلق شيئاً جديداً؟",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1121,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_438280e0494bdd701fa1533b__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Momentum",
    "headline": "site_copy.v3_principle_momentum.label",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "الزخم",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1122,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_f173ce5286c757abae0ce656__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "What can my assets set in motion?",
    "headline": "site_copy.v3_principle_momentum.headline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "ما الذي تستطيع أصولي تحريكه؟",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1123,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_f37f1d1f5be84728c9aa6277__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "The Power of What's Possible",
    "headline": "site_copy.v3_principle_momentum.subheadline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "قوة الممكن",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1124,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_481b1072f8533162432b332f__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Big dreams are something beautiful. Only very few people can tap on their shoulders and say, \"I have turned my dreams into reality\". But which of those dreams are a bubble, the minute you have left the room? A bubble that bursts, because they never became someone elses dream, as well...",
    "headline": "site_copy.v3_principle_legacy.body",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "الأحلام الكبيرة شيء جميل. وقلة قليلة تستطيع أن تربت على كتفها وتقول: «حوّلت أحلامي إلى واقع». لكن أيّ هذه الأحلام يصبح فقاعة بمجرد مغادرتك الغرفة؟ فقاعة تنفجر لأنها لم تصبح أيضاً حلماً لشخص آخر؟",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1125,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_1432897a6136de54f3a8bfcc__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Legacy",
    "headline": "site_copy.v3_principle_legacy.label",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "الإرث",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1126,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_dcf0089b13bd09885bcca8df__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "What outlasts me?",
    "headline": "site_copy.v3_principle_legacy.headline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "ما الذي يبقى بعدي؟",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1127,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_86b7deb07bc216eeb82f9b68__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "You have made it. Has \"it\" made you?",
    "headline": "site_copy.v3_principle_legacy.subheadline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "لقد حقّقت النجاح. فهل شكّلك هذا النجاح؟",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1128,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_d49a66961b072a37974abb90__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Beautiful Success is not measured by how large it becomes.\nScale tells us how far it reaches.\nThe principles tell us whether it is beautiful.",
    "headline": "site_copy.v3_scale.body",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "لا يُقاس النجاح الجميل بحجمه.\nالنطاق يخبرنا إلى أين يصل أثره.\nوالمبادئ تخبرنا إن كان جميلاً.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1129,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
