  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_494140f4069979bf67e59a74__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "From Sickcare to Healthcare",
    "headline": "theses.From Sickcare to Healthcare.title",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "من رعاية المرض إلى رعاية الصحة",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1159,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_6da215f8ba7a2b50479454ce__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "The current system manages sickness.",
    "headline": "theses.From Sickcare to Healthcare.subheadline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "النظام الحالي يدير المرض.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1160,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_836602ad99a6b8851ac43821__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "A planet, populated by 10 Billion humans needs to stay healthy. We cannot afford managing diseases, anymore. Prevention, Quantified self and more will generate real time individual default base lines. Instant action outside of the baseline will ensure that every individual will stay healthy.",
    "headline": "theses.From Sickcare to Healthcare.short_explanation",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "يحتاج كوكب يسكنه 10 مليارات إنسان إلى أن يبقى معافى. لم نعد نستطيع تحمّل الاكتفاء بإدارة الأمراض. ستوفّر الوقاية والقياس الذاتي وغيرهما خطوط أساس فردية آنية. وسيضمن التدخل الفوري عند الخروج عن خط الأساس بقاء كل فرد بصحة جيدة.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1161,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_2e73ef8967de58e956286515__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Longvitality > Longevity",
    "headline": "theses.Longvitality > Longevity.title",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "حيوية مديدة > عمر مديد",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1162,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_f2105755e97e7f95f0e95e2d__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Most of the population does not want to live forever, but no one wants to die over 25 years.",
    "headline": "theses.Longvitality > Longevity.subheadline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "معظم الناس لا يريدون العيش إلى الأبد، لكن لا أحد يريد أن تستغرق وفاته 25 عاماً.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1163,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_22262b2e696624ee0894606f__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Goal of longevity science is to keep humans vital until a dramatically reduced transition out of life. Goal is not to become 125, goal is to stay alive and present and vital until the last breath.",
    "headline": "theses.Longvitality > Longevity.short_explanation",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "هدف علم إطالة العمر هو الحفاظ على حيوية الإنسان حتى مرحلة انتقال أخيرة أقصر بكثير. ليس الهدف بلوغ 125 عاماً، بل البقاء حياً وحاضراً ومفعماً بالحيوية حتى النفس الأخير.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1164,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_35fd6c340cbf086db136e6a0__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Free Gas > Subsidized fueling",
    "headline": "theses.Free Gas > Subsidized fueling.title",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "وقود مجاني > دعم الوقود",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1165,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_b2d4275a17adf42db9ad749b__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "If driving a car is an achieved right of urban society, it should be free within reason.",
    "headline": "theses.Free Gas > Subsidized fueling.subheadline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "إذا كانت قيادة السيارة حقاً مكتسباً في المجتمع الحضري، فينبغي أن تكون مجانية ضمن المعقول.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1166,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_b57a67ed0d9eab976844bdfb__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Subsidizing gas prizes is very expensive and does not have any impact on the invidividual. One free tank per month covers \"the right to drive\", everything beyond driving a tank to zero shall be paid at regular rate",
    "headline": "theses.Free Gas > Subsidized fueling.short_explanation",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "دعم أسعار الوقود مكلف جداً ولا يترك أثراً على الفرد. يغطي خزان مجاني واحد شهرياً «حق القيادة»، وما يتجاوز استهلاك هذا الخزان يُدفع بسعره المعتاد.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1167,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_2a26b72ed525a4a4b90b2770__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "From \"be loved\" to \"build love\"",
    "headline": "theses.From \"be loved\" to \"build love\".title",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "من «أن أكون محبوباً» إلى «أن أبني المحبة»",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1168,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_11c5c7ce4d4e3c878f681b2b__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "A shift in perspective. Dont ask \"Am I loved?\", but: \"Do I create Love?\"",
    "headline": "theses.From \"be loved\" to \"build love\".subheadline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "تحوّل في المنظور. لا تسأل: «هل أنا محبوب؟»، بل: «هل أصنع المحبة؟»",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1169,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_de170dcf9ed089388fd87ade__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Every human creates an echo of their interaction with other humans. \"Am I loved\" is a function of needing and just creates addictive needing. \"Do I create Love\" is a function of expanding and enriches a whole culture. How much love is left, when you leave the room?",
    "headline": "theses.From \"be loved\" to \"build love\".short_explanation",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "يترك كل إنسان صدى لتفاعله مع الآخرين. سؤال «هل أنا محبوب؟» ينطلق من الاحتياج ولا يصنع إلا احتياجاً متكرراً. أما «هل أصنع المحبة؟» فينطلق من التوسّع ويثري ثقافة بأكملها. كم من المحبة يبقى حين تغادر الغرفة؟",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1170,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_be2fc6b48c965cd6650367cd__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Work Forward",
    "headline": "theses.Work Forward.title",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "العمل نحو الأمام",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1171,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_4c6e571c28296251cbc11f31__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Whatever you do, follow a play forward mission",
    "headline": "theses.Work Forward.subheadline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "مهما فعلت، اتبع رسالة يمتد أثرها إلى المستقبل",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1172,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_f9bd39f525d3b157b6a4e478__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "If we want to safe \"Job\", we have to attach meaning to it, meaning that goes beyond transactional motives like salary. Doctors WANT to heal patients. Students WANT to pass class. Firefighters WANT to put down fire. Meaning will not be replaced by technology.",
    "headline": "theses.Work Forward.short_explanation",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "إذا أردنا إنقاذ «الوظيفة»، فعلينا ربطها بمعنى يتجاوز الدوافع التبادلية كالراتب. الأطباء يريدون شفاء المرضى. والطلاب يريدون اجتياز الصف. ورجال الإطفاء يريدون إخماد النار. لن تحل التكنولوجيا محل المعنى.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1173,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_b649708bdf986d6b246a20a1__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Healthy food is free. Unhealthy food is expensive.",
    "headline": "theses.Healthy food is free. Unhealthy food is expensive..title",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "الغذاء الصحي مجاني. وغير الصحي مكلف.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1174,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_1f68ca707263f5bc8f367cba__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Water and Apples come free. Sodas and Burgers are taxed heavily",
    "headline": "theses.Healthy food is free. Unhealthy food is expensive..subheadline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "الماء والتفاح مجانيان. والمشروبات الغازية والبرغر يخضعان لضرائب مرتفعة",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1175,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_f36ef9963618cf406c20758d__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "To make people eat a healthy and balanced diet, impact follows pain: when it gets expensive, people will consider. When its free, people will follow.",
    "headline": "theses.Healthy food is free. Unhealthy food is expensive..short_explanation",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "لتشجيع الناس على غذاء صحي ومتوازن، يأتي الأثر بعد الألم: حين ترتفع التكلفة، يعيد الناس النظر. وحين يكون الأمر مجانياً، يقبلون عليه.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1176,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_5ce5efea31ee4661659e7b4d__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Non lifestyle investments should be free",
    "headline": "theses.Non lifestyle investments should be free.title",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "الاستثمارات الضرورية ينبغي أن تكون بلا فوائد",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1177,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_25d900b586bfbe85f21ea285__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "No interest for necessary investments, high interest for lifestyle investment.",
    "headline": "theses.Non lifestyle investments should be free.subheadline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "بلا فوائد للاستثمارات الضرورية، وبفوائد مرتفعة لاستثمارات نمط الحياة.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1178,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_67ab642f122b0184d422c7d2__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Take you need € 10.000 to repair your bathroom, but you dont have the money: the loan shall be free. If you need € 100.000 it is more likely the change is not of fundamental necessity, the loan is not free. If you need € 1.000.000, it is very likely a pure lifestyle choice and the loan will be expensive.",
    "headline": "theses.Non lifestyle investments should be free.short_explanation",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "لنفترض أنك تحتاج إلى 10,000 يورو لإصلاح حمّامك ولا تملك المال: ينبغي أن يكون القرض بلا فوائد. وإذا احتجت إلى 100,000 يورو، فمن الأرجح أن التغيير ليس ضرورة أساسية، فلا يكون القرض مجانياً. وإذا احتجت إلى مليون يورو، فهو على الأرجح خيار متعلق بنمط الحياة، وسيكون القرض مكلفاً.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1179,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_8ab1e04479ddce98f0d1d25d__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Travel will become the Life-API",
    "headline": "theses.Travel will become the Life-API.title",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "السفر سيصبح واجهة الحياة البرمجية",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1180,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_4eb311c1142dc073b6b3b4da__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Wherever people travel, the journey will be an extended System of their life.",
    "headline": "theses.Travel will become the Life-API.subheadline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "أينما سافر الناس، ستصبح الرحلة امتداداً لنظام حياتهم.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1181,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_592dfc655ba6d594223d85ff__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "People will travel to learn, understand, connect or escape. Every journey will become part of the travelers Operating System. For hospitality this also means hyperindividualization and data-inspired curation of the guest experience.",
    "headline": "theses.Travel will become the Life-API.short_explanation",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "سيسافر الناس ليتعلموا أو يفهموا أو يتواصلوا أو يبتعدوا. وستصبح كل رحلة جزءاً من نظام تشغيل المسافر. ويعني ذلك للضيافة أيضاً تخصيصاً بالغ الدقة وانتقاءً لتجربة الضيف مستلهماً من البيانات.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1182,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_34cfd3ba361012a44deb5a8a__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Manage Curiosity",
    "headline": "theses.Manage Curiosity.title",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "إدارة الفضول",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1183,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_e3e8cf408a732475fc8eb55b__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "The Next Role of Schools",
    "headline": "theses.Manage Curiosity.subheadline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "الدور المقبل للمدارس",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1184,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_dd09e9c0464c1caa29e018e8__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "The role of school is not to educate a curriculum. Content is available for free. Students have access to more information than any expert in history. Schools should identify curiosity and guide it toward meaningful sources.",
    "headline": "theses.Manage Curiosity.short_explanation",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "دور المدرسة ليس تلقين المنهج. فالمحتوى متاح مجاناً، والطلاب يصلون إلى معلومات أكثر مما أتيح لأي خبير في التاريخ. ينبغي للمدارس أن تكتشف الفضول وتوجّهه إلى مصادر هادفة.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1185,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_5377cc9cbf0145ce3dcf35a7__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Create Architects of the Future",
    "headline": "theses.Create Architects of the Future.title",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "إعداد معماريّي المستقبل",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1186,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_ecb30a789812266a6a0b0378__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Todays education helps us understanding the present by explaining the past. The future will not necessarily build on the past.",
    "headline": "theses.Create Architects of the Future.subheadline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "يساعدنا تعليم اليوم على فهم الحاضر بشرح الماضي. لكن المستقبل لن يبني بالضرورة على الماضي.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1187,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_af639a107a893490814db125__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "It takes untrained skills to anticipate a future that does not follow a linear path from experience. Thinking exponentially is a required trait to envision the future, design and execute it - but also understand living in it.",
    "headline": "theses.Create Architects of the Future.short_explanation",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "يتطلب توقّع مستقبل لا يتبع مساراً خطياً من الخبرة مهارات لم نتدرّب عليها. والتفكير الأُسّي قدرة ضرورية لتخيّل المستقبل وتصميمه وتنفيذه، وكذلك لفهم العيش فيه.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1188,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_eff6638e2a864f2dc3c4b3a4__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "UBA over UBI",
    "headline": "theses.UBA over UBI.title",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "الإتاحة الأساسية الشاملة قبل الدخل الأساسي الشامل",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1189,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_67bb75dd95eda76b39508fc0__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Universal Basic Access keeps the lights on. Literally",
    "headline": "theses.UBA over UBI.subheadline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "الإتاحة الأساسية الشاملة تُبقي الأنوار مضاءة. حرفياً",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1190,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_0787fe0e56a26f54df3d5b48__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Instead of distributing money, fundamental/basic needs are always free: light is always on, fridge is always cold. Anything lifestyle has to be paid: plug your phone, pay for electricity.",
    "headline": "theses.UBA over UBI.short_explanation",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "بدلاً من توزيع المال، تكون الاحتياجات الأساسية مجانية دائماً: الضوء متاح والثلاجة باردة. أما ما يتصل بنمط الحياة فيُدفع ثمنه: اشحن هاتفك، وادفع تكلفة الكهرباء.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1191,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_d538f159b5d43f861edeba4c__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "When is Public Transport Free?",
    "headline": "theses.When is Public Transport Free?.title",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "متى يكون النقل العام مجانياً؟",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1192,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_ec6f56778e145be49af95342__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "Leaving the car at home can be incentivized: create circumstances under which an urban citizen can use public transport for free",
    "headline": "theses.When is Public Transport Free?.subheadline",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "يمكن تشجيع ترك السيارة في المنزل بتهيئة ظروف تتيح لسكان المدن استخدام النقل العام مجاناً",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1193,
    "is_active": true
  },
  {
    "content_key": "text_23019abed5ffe4f25755d8b1__ar",
    "locale": "ar",
    "section": "translations",
    "label": "The motive of mobility determins the cost of travel. If you travel to work, to school, to university, travel should be free. If you dont have a job, are not in education, you pay full rate.",
    "headline": "theses.When is Public Transport Free?.short_explanation",
    "subheadline": null,
    "body": "دافع التنقل يحدّد تكلفة الرحلة. إذا كنت تذهب إلى العمل أو المدرسة أو الجامعة، فينبغي أن يكون التنقل مجانياً. وإذا لم تكن تعمل أو تدرس، فتدفع السعر الكامل.",
    "media_url": null,
    "media_path": null,
    "display_order": 1194,
    "is_active": true
  },
